      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "We have completed breakover operations for the Neutron Stage 2 tank assembly, rotating the stage horizontal – a critical step in the handling of large rocket sections for integration and assembly. \n \nHere’s a last look at Stage 2 on the Neutron Factory floor before it’s wrapped up (literally) for barge shipment to LC-3 on Wallops Island where its fluid systems will be tested and its Archimedes vacuum engine installed.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 58,
        "likes": 1503,
        "quotes": 51,
