      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Operations will begin shortly for our 98th Electron launch and next mission from LC-1 for @hawkeye360.\n\n'We're Not Hawking Around' launch window opens:\n🚀8:00pm NZDT\n🚀07:00 UTC\n🚀3:00 am EDT \n🚀00:00 am PDT",
