      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-19T22:21:48.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-20 06:21:48",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Wet Dress Rehearsal DONE ✅ Electron is ready for its 98th launch and latest mission from Launch Complex 1.\n\n'We're Not Hawking Around' will deploy 3x HAWK satellites to a 520km LEO for @hawkeye360 to expand their RF-sensing constellation that collects signal data for maritime tracking, radar monitoring, and more.\n\nThe launch window opens tomorrow, Oct 21:\n🚀8:00pm NZDT\n🚀07:00 UTC\n🚀3:00 am EDT \n🚀00:00 am PDT",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 0,
        "likes": 194,
        "quotes": 2,
        "replies": 10,
        "retweets": 33,
        "views": 6809
      },
