        "name": "NASA Mars",
        "text": "Perseverance has set a new off-world record! 🏅\n\nOn Oct. 11, the rover's odometer hit 28.10 miles (45.22 kilometers), eclipsing the distance record set by NASA's Opportunity rover.  1/2",
